{# narrative_engine/probe — one round of the decision API probe.
   Sent once per round and order by the Plots tab's "Probe decisions"
   button; DecisionProbe logs what came back. Not part of any feature.
   Receives: situation, question, background_in_state (bool),
     options [{ key, name, background }] — keys c1 onward.
   With background_in_state, each option's background goes in the
   choices block and its criteria line carries only its name; otherwise
   the background rides on the criteria line itself.
   NOTE: no fenced blocks and no literal braces anywhere in this file. #}
[ state situation ]
{{ situation }}
[ end state ]

{% if background_in_state %}[ state choices ]
{% for o in options %}{{ o.key }}, {{ o.name }}: {{ o.background }}
{% endfor %}[ end state ]

{% endif %}[ question pick choice ]
{{ question }} Judge each choice by what is said about it here, not by what you might already believe about it.
[ criteria ]
{% for o in options %}{% if background_in_state %}{{ o.key }}: {{ o.name }}{% else %}{{ o.key }}: {{ o.name }}, {{ o.background }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}[ end criteria ]
[ end question ]
